gametitle=Grand Theft Auto: Vice City (NTSC-U Day 1 SLUS-20552 / CRC 20B19E49)
comment=Version 1.03. Right-stick Orbit, on-foot First Person, and vehicle Hood camera.
comment=Press D-Pad Down to toggle the camera mod on/off with stock or Zeroable modern controls.
comment=Select cycles far, medium, near, then First Person on foot or Hood in supported vehicles.
comment=Vertical look follows the game's Invert Look option. Stick response and distances use verified San Andreas PS2 tuning.
comment=R3 temporarily looks backward. Hold native L1 (modern on-foot R1) to smoothly center the view.
comment=Requires a full restart and memory-card load. New tuning and Hood view need gameplay validation.
[GTA-PS2-Modern-Controls\Right Stick Camera and First Person - Toggle with D-Pad Down]
description=D-Pad Down toggles the mod. Select cycles far/medium/near/First Person on foot and far/medium/near/Hood in supported vehicles. Uses game inversion. R3 looks backward; native L1 (modern on-foot R1) centers. Full restart and memory-card load required.
author=Zeroable
comment=Stock controls supported. The separate known Zeroable remapper is optional; no remapping is bundled.
